{
  "id": "13-fabric-youtube-case-study",
  "title": "A convincing Fabric answer still needs a check",
  "script_sha256": "a75cf76fae4a248f965b000a0ad97bd25a8c708186a9246a9784ae59ff89c1aa",
  "duration": 62.8693,
  "beats": [
    {
      "scene": "hook",
      "text": "A Fabric agent answered the question. Then the presenter checked Power BI, and spotted rounding. Watch the validation.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.3067,
      "voice_end": 7.1467
    },
    {
      "scene": "case",
      "text": "Guy in a Cube built this agent over their YouTube analytics. A semantic model for video statistics, and a lakehouse for comment sentiment.",
      "start": 7.3067,
      "end": 15.552,
      "voice_end": 15.392
    },
    {
      "scene": "definitions",
      "text": "Before testing, they clarify an easy trap. A like on a comment is not a like on a video. Their instructions define those terms and point questions to the right source.",
      "start": 15.552,
      "end": 25.7813,
      "voice_end": 25.6213
    },
    {
      "scene": "question",
      "text": "Their first test asks for total views on January tenth, twenty twenty five. A question with a checkable answer.",
      "start": 25.7813,
      "end": 32.4907,
      "voice_end": 32.3307
    },
    {
      "scene": "query",
      "text": "They open the generated DAX, then compare the result with a table built from the same Power BI model.",
      "start": 32.4907,
      "end": 38.9867,
      "voice_end": 38.8267
    },
    {
      "scene": "precision",
      "text": "The presenter notices that the chat rounds the number. That's a precision issue to evaluate, not proof that the agent invented the answer.",
      "start": 38.9867,
      "end": 47.0187,
      "voice_end": 46.8587
    },
    {
      "scene": "second",
      "text": "Then they test the most viewed video with Fabric in its title. Check the text filter, the ranking, and the result against the report.",
      "start": 47.0187,
      "end": 54.6453,
      "voice_end": 54.4853
    },
    {
      "scene": "close",
      "text": "Use that method for your first Fabric agent. Define the business terms. Inspect the query. Compare with a trusted result. Then share.",
      "start": 54.6453,
      "end": 62.8693,
      "voice_end": 62.7093
    }
  ],
